cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package or build on this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "An Empirical Analysis of the Energy Consumption in Python JSON Libraries: json vs orjson"
abstract: >-
  Replication package for a controlled experiment comparing the energy
  consumption and performance of Python's standard library json module
  (C-accelerated) and the Rust-based orjson library on JSON serialisation
  (dumps) and deserialisation (loads). The experiment uses synthetic payloads
  of varying complexity and real-world JSON documents, and measures energy
  with EnergiBridge on the Green Lab gl3 server at Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam.
